  "nl_text": "The database schema named 'rschema_0430' consists of six tables: 'user', 'attraction', 'message', 'ticket_booking', 'attraction_comment', and 'attraction_favorite'.\nThe 'user' table is used to store user information including account creation time, account update time, email, full name, password, QQ number, remarks, user ID, user name, and WeChat open ID. Each column is designed to hold data of its respective type, with null values allowed.\nThe 'attraction' table is used to store information about attractions, including creation time, attraction ID, attraction name, details, era, images, reference price, region, type, and update time. Each column is designed to hold data of its respective type, with null values allowed.\nThe 'message' table is used to store messages, with content, creation time, ID, update time, and a foreign key referencing the 'user' table's user ID.\nThe 'ticket_booking' table is used to store ticket booking information, including attraction ID, booking date, order creation time, order status, order update time, remarks, ticket quantity, and user ID. It has a composite primary key consisting of user ID, attraction ID, and order update time, and foreign keys referencing the 'user' and 'attraction' tables' respective IDs.\nThe 'attraction_comment' table is used to store comments on attractions, including attraction ID, comment content, comment creation time, comment update time, review status, and user ID. It has a composite primary key consisting of user ID, attraction ID, and comment creation time, and foreign keys referencing the 'user' and 'attraction' tables' respective IDs.\nFinally, the 'attraction_favorite' table is used to store information about which attractions a user has favorited, including attraction ID, favorite creation time, favorite update time, and user ID. It has a composite primary key consisting of user ID, attraction ID, and favorite creation time, and foreign keys referencing the 'user' and 'attraction' tables' respective IDs. All columns allow null values and have referential integrity constraints to ensure data consistency.",
  "gold_question": "The system shall manage user basic information, including username, password, WeChat Open ID, name, QQ number, email, remarks, and the creation and update time of the account. The system shall also manage attraction information, including attraction name, details, reference price, images, era, type, region, and the creation and update time of the attraction. Users shall be able to book attraction tickets, with order information including user, attraction, booking date, ticket quantity, remarks, order status, and the creation and update time of the order. Users shall be able to comment on attractions, with comment information including user, attraction, comment content, review status, and the creation and update time of the comment. Users shall be able to leave messages on the platform, with message information including user, message content, and the creation and update time of the message. Additionally, users shall be able to favorite attractions of interest, with favorite information including user, attraction, and the creation and update time of the favorite.",
  "input_json": "/data/RSchema_ExpResults4/Experiment2/schema2text_deepseek/0430.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0430\nCREATE TABLE `user` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `full_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `password` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `qq_number` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `remarks` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `user_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `wechat_open_id` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `created_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `updated_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `attraction` (\n  `attraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `attraction_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `details` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `era` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `images` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `reference_price` decimal(10,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `region` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `type` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `created_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `updated_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`attraction_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `message` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `content` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `created_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `updated_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `message_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `ticket_booking` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `attraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `booking_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `order_created_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `order_status` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `order_updated_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `remarks` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `ticket_quantity` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`, `attraction_id`, `order_updated_at`),\n  CONSTRAINT `ticket_booking_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `ticket_booking_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`attraction_id`) REFERENCES `attraction` (`attraction_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `attraction_comment` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `attraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `comment_content` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `comment_created_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `comment_updated_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `review_status` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`, `attraction_id`, `comment_created_at`),\n  CONSTRAINT `attraction_comment_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `attraction_comment_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`attraction_id`) REFERENCES `attraction` (`attraction_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `attraction_favorite` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `attraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `favorite_created_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `favorite_updated_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`, `attraction_id`, `favorite_created_at`),\n  CONSTRAINT `attraction_favorite_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `attraction_favorite_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`attraction_id`) REFERENCES `attraction` (`attraction_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
